  {
   "id": "moss-the-forgotten-relic-401893@1.0.1",
   "gameId": "moss-the-forgotten-relic-401893",
   "displayName": "Hotfix 1.0.1",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-07-24T21:46:13.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Thanks to everyone for your feedback and bug reporting! We're working on getting builds with fixes out as quickly as possible, and have a small patch to push today.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Hotfix 1.0.1 Patch Notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Properly support multiple plugged in controllers. All plugged in controllers can now be used to control Quill. Rumble goes to the most recently used controller. This should dramatically improve the experience of players using a controller on Steam Deck, and players playing with virtual controllers.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for occasional crash when skipping combat.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please keep it coming! If you run into any issues, or have feedback, you can always find us at our support page.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "What's Next",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We've got more fixes and updates based on feedback which should be ready next week. These should include:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Better Steam Deck options.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixes to gameplay blockers.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "More crash fixes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And more to come, so stay tuned!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
